  "description": "Eighteen-year-old Misa has spent her life feeling desperately alone, enduring abuse at her orphanage and bullying at school. Everything changes when she is hit by a car during a school trip and wakes up to find herself ten years older, with no memory of the past decade. She is now twenty-eight, a teacher, and married to a handsome man she has no memory of ever meeting. Forced to navigate adulthood while still feeling like her teenage self, Misa must piece together what happened during those missing years and decide whether she can trust her seemingly perfect husband.\n\n_Source: Tappytoon_",
